cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite the archived v0.8.1 release and describe the
  configuration-specific evidence boundary rather than claiming universal
  accessibility or complete WCAG conformance.
title: "Accessible Questionnaire Platform"
version: "0.8.1"
date-released: "2026-08-24"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Wang"
    given-names: "Yurui"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SaSoup-YR/accessible-questionnaire-platform"
url: "https://sasoup-yr.github.io/accessible-questionnaire-platform/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - accessibility
  - questionnaires
  - assistive technology
  - web platform
  - research prototype
abstract: >-
  A bounded loaded-definition questionnaire research prototype with shared
  participant interaction, explicit scoring and provenance contracts,
  fail-closed recovery, structured import and configuration-specific technical
  and manual accessibility evidence. Version 0.8.1 adds the public platform entry
  and repository curation without changing the Version 0.8 questionnaire/result
  protocol or moving the immutable v0.8.0 tag. The release does not establish
  universal accessibility, psychometric equivalence, usability improvement or
  disabled-user benefit.
